T* (Conservative fail-safe ordering: U4A opens the 230 VAC relay 2.31 s BEFORE U4B raises GPIO20 HIGH during startup self-test \(< 25 s ceiling\); 1 kHz) Tj
T* (runaway capped at 0.745 V max.) Tj
